  "bio": "Mark Dorazio has lived a principled life of service dedicated to God, family, community, and conservative values. Mark was the 4th boy, born to a large Italian family of 10 children in Derry, PA. He started working and paying rent at age 12 delivering the local newspaper. He followed his oldest brother to Lubbock, TX out of high school, and apprenticed in construction under three engineers that taught at Texas Tech University. He met his wife, Monica in El Paso, and they have been married for 40 adventurous years. They raised four children, and now enjoy their eleven grandchildren. Together they opened their own construction company, Dorazio Enterprises, Inc., after moving to San Antonio. Over the last 38 years Mark and Monica have grown their.",
